      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## FLUX.3 Image Klein, distilled int8 (text + reference images)\n\nOptional second image engine. The installer does not download it; put these files into `ComfyUI/models/` (FLUX.3 Image Klein ComfyUI release, black-forest-labs on Hugging Face):\n\n- **diffusion_models**: `flux3_image_klein_sd_int8_convrot.safetensors` (step-distilled)\n- **text_encoders**: `qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors` (Qwen3-VL-4B text encoder, int8)\n- **vae**: `flux2-vae.safetensors`\n\nNeeds ComfyUI 0.41 or newer (core `ReferenceMultiLatent` node).\n\n**Sampler:** 16 steps, CFG 1, er_sde / simple. The checkpoint is distilled, so there is no negative prompt (CFG 1 ignores it). 4-16 steps also work; fewer is faster and softer.\n\n**References:** up to 10 pictures on `Set Reference Multi Latent` (`images.image0`, `image1`, ...). In the prompt the first one is `<ref_image_0>`, the next `<ref_image_1>`; Acre Art Studio translates its own `<image1>` tokens automatically. Each reference is resized to about 1 MP and VAE-encoded. With no picture connected the node passes the prompt through unchanged.\n\n**Prompting:** full scene captions in sentences (framing, subject, background, lighting). For edits describe the finished picture with the change folded in.\n\n**Licence:** FLUX Kommunity License: non-commercial, plus commercial output for users under US$5M yearly revenue."
      ],
      "title": "Notes"
    }
